---
description: Documentation and release notes rules
globs:
  - "README.md"
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - ".changeset/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep docs aligned with real code changes; English only.
- User-visible package changes add a changeset (`pnpm changeset`); `docs/UPGRADING.md` explains migrations.
- Repository-only changes (docs, tooling, CI) go to `docs/CHANGELOG.md` and need no changeset.
- Never tag or publish from a workstation or an agent; see `docs/RELEASE.md`.
